    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="823a0e8a-ba60-5d20-bd36-cc241217e0de" activityNameId="d92b5fb2-73f8-5649-8bd8-70f30120b160" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Operation, passenger car, electric, LiMn2O4, city car</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Operation, passenger car, electric, LiMn2O4, city car
Average data for the operation of an light weight concept (650kg) battery electric vehicle. Electricity certified. Input and emission of refrigerant used for air conditioning was added by A.Messmer.;
UUID: 5aa09d04-42df-36b1-8438-2d0251d81bdf
Energy consumption from certfied electricity is included. Emissions of particulate matters and heavy metals are accounted for, unless of combustion origin. Particulate emissions comprise abrasions emissions only.  Heavy metal emissions to soil and water caused by tyre abrasion are included. Real consumption surplus of 70% added. AM 22.7.2016
Location: Data refer to Swiss conditions
Technology: BEV, LiMn2O4/graphite battery pack, 100Wh/kg, actual standard, 2009
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: Emission extrapolated from ICE passenger car according to weight ratio
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5aa09d04-42df-36b1-8438-2d0251d81bdf.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
